出会いは ふとした瞬間 帰り道の交差点で 声をかけてくれたね 「一緒に帰ろう」
Our meeting was a sudden moment at the intersection on the way home, you called out to me, "Let's go home together"

590
00:59:59,342 --> 01:00:03,142
僕は照れくさそうに
I was shyly...

591
01:00:04,157 --> 01:00:05,957
顔隠しながら
While hiding my face...

592
01:00:06,157 --> 01:00:11,857
本当は とても とても 嬉しかったよ
...I was actually really, really happy.

593
01:00:13,457 --> 01:00:19,257
あぁ 花火が夜空 きれいに咲いて ちょっとセツナク
Ah, fireworks bloom beautifully in the night sky, a bit bittersweet.

594
01:00:19,957 --> 01:00:25,657
あぁ 風が時間とともに流れる
Ah, the wind flows along with time.

595
01:00:26,157 --> 01:00:32,657
嬉しくって 楽しくって 冒険もいろいろしたね
So happy, so fun, we had all kinds of adventures, didn't we?

596
01:00:32,657 --> 01:00:38,657
二人の 秘密の 基地の中
Inside our secret base.

597
01:00:39,657 --> 01:00:45,957
君と夏の終わり 将来の夢 大きな希望 忘れない
With you at the end of summer, dreams of the future, big hopes—I won't forget.

598
01:00:46,157 --> 01:00:52,957
10年後の8月 また出会えるのを 信じて
Believing we'll meet again in August 10 years from now.

599
01:00:52,957 --> 01:00:59,457
君が最後まで 心から 「ありがとう」叫んでいたこと 知っていたよ
I knew that until the end, you were shouting "Thank you" from your heart.

600
