涙をこらえて 笑顔でさようなら せつないよね
Holding back tears, saying goodbye with a smile—it's bittersweet.

608
01:01:52,957 --> 01:01:59,957
最高の思い出を
The greatest memories...

609
01:02:00,157 --> 01:02:04,957
突然の転校で
Suddenly transferring schools...

610
01:02:06,657 --> 01:02:12,157
どうしようもなく
...there was nothing I could do.

611
01:02:12,957 --> 01:02:18,657
手紙書くよ 電話もするよ
I'll write letters, I'll call you too.

612
01:02:18,957 --> 01:02:25,957
忘れないでね 僕のことを
Don't forget me...

613
01:02:25,957 --> 01:02:31,357
いつまでも 二人の 基地の中
...forever inside our secret base.

614
01:02:32,157 --> 01:02:38,157
君と夏の終わり ずっと話して
With you at the end of summer, talking forever.

615
